  - group actions
  - LLM-written search programs
abstract: "Explicit covering arrays for 47 parameter sets of the ca-tools covering array table: 18 at strength 3 (v = 5 to 24), 28 at strength 4 (v = 3, 5, 6, 7, 10, 12) and one at strength 5 (v = 4); 40 of them hold the best known size on 2026-11-02, including CA(2616; 4, 10, 6) (previous best 3208), CA(3000; 4, 11, 6) (3671), CA(1006; 4, 8, 5) (1125) and CA(6947; 4, 35, 6) (7185). Obtained by orbit search under PGL(2, q), unions of cosets of linear codes and post-optimisation of the published record arrays, with C search programs written by Claude Opus, and verified exhaustively by two independent checkers."
